    "de": "E-Scooter-Beschränkungszonen Wien",
    "en": "E-Scooter Restriction Zones  <br> In order to ensure better coexistence in public space, some rules have been drawn up for sharing mobility providers (e.g. e-scooter providers). Zones with specific restrictions are defined: parking bans, speed limits or parking options, including e.g. pedestrian zones, meeting zones and permanent market areas."
